    "text": "A protein &lsquo;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></math>&rsquo; with molecular weight of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>70</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></math>, on hydrolysis gives amino acids. One of these amino acid is",
